    route3_rise_node_blocklist = "PreSwoop,LoopTheLoop,HoverBackward,Hovering",-- ⛔ nodes that HARD-CRASH (native AV, uncatchable) or break the camera -- refuse to fire. The whole Fly.Hovering.* family AVs when force-fired cold (crash tape: HoverBackward + HoverUpward AV'd from ground).
