    route3_carry_ox_pose_mode = "default_body",-- OX-carry body pose. "flap" (DEFAULT, Aurora-verified 2026-07-13: works, grip correct) = ridden flap + AddBringOx. "native" (BROKE in test: L0 stuck) = let the Catch node drive its own base. "default_body" (BROKE: no grip) = flap without AddBringOx. Kept as live A/B toggles; the original talon-break appears INTERMITTENT, not caused by this.
