    route3_predation_pin_caught_offset = true,                     -- ⭐ POSITION FIX (Iris 2026-07-13): overwrite the native CAUGHT-OFFSET (setCaughtOffset) with a FIXED value each frame so the ox sits at the TALON regardless of how far you grabbed from. The native follow re-writes the ox to R_PropA + caughtOffset every frame; caughtOffset was the GRAB-TIME offset (grab from far = ox hangs far / at ground). false = keep native grab-time offset.
